      "abstained": false,
      "answer": "When gloves are worn in combination with other PPE, they are put on last. Gowns are usually the first piece of PPE to be donned. Gloves that fit snugly around the wrist are preferred with an isolation gown because they will cover the gown cuff and provide a more reliable continuous barrier for the arms, wrists, and hands.",
